</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Doom Slayer Eternal [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Known Issues</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>I will say, I’m using a different material so I can get my emissive parts to work so you’ll notice that in-shadow the character will seem quite dark.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Recommended Mods</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1788-wtt-head-and-voice-selector/?highlight=voice#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Head and Voice Selector</a> - so you can, you know, select the heads</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Commissions &amp; Donations</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Look into commissions or donate on my Ko-Fi. Send a message <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/trappucci\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/trappucci</a></li>\n<li>Check out my other work on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Credits</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=3db4257c32909851&amp;sxsrf=ADLYWIJo9eyqxGq353gwkyzOT32QAITSNg:1729979108196&amp;q=id+Software&amp;si=ACC90nyvvWro6QmnyY1IfSdgk5wwjB1r8BGd_IWRjXqmKPQqm55xvOvfACzeS_2Fe6IMxqB60yrvI3hJkzn3w07NXlssym8U74a4b9EZUtbvnsM9uh7kCo5h4GhFas7Q70VB4q8axXuQ7E3xkCnBbZvVUs0rwwM0D3bjhWlWcDPsbM600Iqh2tlWgkUW3LHegscvdgDG9f4992vGBw7shEIPFgmIl01iaI0ER9Uj4onynUxWhwUhAi2IanrPCCp4t6MMuM5bWtD-rm3fCNSaXoLN3bsC3fk50g%3D%3D&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjg2dmxgq2JAxXrkokEHdS_GA0QmxMoAHoECCgQAg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">id Software</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=3db4257c32909851&amp;sxsrf=ADLYWIJo9eyqxGq353gwkyzOT32QAITSNg:1729979108196&amp;q=Panic+Button+Games&amp;si=ACC90ny8E30vD16OoPAAI4cStfcliGy35W8UAhb0TsHNc_ISQdEX6